{
  "$comment": "模块发布清单（tag 发布流水线）：每个模块 = 一组部署文件（仓库相对路径 → 手机绝对路径）。面板 apply 时，mod-release 按本清单从 GitHub Contents API 自拉文件（compare 得出受影响模块，再按 consumers 扩展为「所有消费该变更文件的模块」）、node --check 门禁后复制到运行目录并按 applyOrder 重启对应 runit 服务。",
  "version": 1,
  "modules": {
    "checkin": {
      "service": "mon-checkin",
      "files": {
        "monitor/mod-checkin.js": "~/monitor/mod-checkin.js",
        "monitor/lib/module.js": "~/monitor/lib/module.js",
        "monitor/lib/checkin/autoclaw.js": "~/monitor/lib/checkin/autoclaw.js",
        "monitor/lib/checkin/codearts.js": "~/monitor/lib/checkin/codearts.js",
        "monitor/lib/checkin/officeace.js": "~/monitor/lib/checkin/officeace.js",
        "monitor/lib/checkin/checkin.js": "~/monitor/lib/checkin/checkin.js",
        "monitor/lib/checkin/scheduler.js": "~/monitor/lib/checkin/scheduler.js",
        "monitor/lib/checkin/credit-expiry.js": "~/monitor/lib/checkin/credit-expiry.js",
        "monitor/lib/checkin-log.js": "~/monitor/lib/checkin-log.js",
        "monitor/lib/checkin-stats.js": "~/monitor/lib/checkin-stats.js",
        "monitor/lib/providers/index.js": "~/monitor/lib/providers/index.js",
        "monitor/lib/providers/common.js": "~/monitor/lib/providers/common.js",
        "monitor/lib/providers/trae.js": "~/monitor/lib/providers/trae.js",
        "monitor/lib/providers/workbuddy.js": "~/monitor/lib/providers/workbuddy.js",
        "monitor/lib/providers/codearts.js": "~/monitor/lib/providers/codearts.js",
        "monitor/lib/providers/autoclaw.js": "~/monitor/lib/providers/autoclaw.js",
        "monitor/lib/providers/officeace.js": "~/monitor/lib/providers/officeace.js",
        "monitor/lib/tasks/index.js": "~/monitor/lib/tasks/index.js"
      }
    },
    "gateway": {
      "service": "server",
      "disruptive": true,
      "files": {
        "monitor/server.js": "~/monitor/server.js",
        "monitor/lib/utils.js": "~/monitor/lib/utils.js",
        "monitor/lib/module.js": "~/monitor/lib/module.js",
        "monitor/lib/metrics.js": "~/monitor/lib/metrics.js",
        "monitor/lib/recorder.js": "~/monitor/lib/recorder.js",
        "monitor/lib/actions.js": "~/monitor/lib/actions.js",
        "monitor/lib/files.js": "~/monitor/lib/files.js",
        "monitor/lib/logger.js": "~/monitor/lib/logger.js",
        "monitor/lib/notify.js": "~/monitor/lib/notify.js",
        "monitor/lib/daily-report.js": "~/monitor/lib/daily-report.js",
        "monitor/lib/alert-events.js": "~/monitor/lib/alert-events.js",
        "monitor/lib/subscription.js": "~/monitor/lib/subscription.js",
        "monitor/package.json": "~/monitor/package.json"
      }
    },
    "release": {
      "service": "mon-release",
      "files": {
        "monitor/mod-release.js": "~/monitor/mod-release.js",
        "monitor/release-manifest.json": "~/monitor/release-manifest.json",
        "monitor/lib/module.js": "~/monitor/lib/module.js"
      }
    },
    "frontend": {
      "service": null,
      "$comment": "前端（CF Pages）走 GitHub Actions 自动发布（.github/workflows/deploy-frontend.yml），tag 流程不涉及前端",
      "files": {
        "monitor/frontend/checkin.html": "CF_PAGES",
        "monitor/frontend/release.html": "CF_PAGES",
        "monitor/frontend/index.html": "CF_PAGES",
        "monitor/frontend/notify.html": "CF_PAGES",
        "monitor/frontend/subscription.html": "CF_PAGES",
        "monitor/frontend/files.html": "CF_PAGES",
        "monitor/frontend/android.html": "CF_PAGES",
        "monitor/frontend/config.js": "CF_PAGES",
        "monitor/frontend/_worker.js": "CF_PAGES"
      }
    }
  },
  "shared": {
    "$comment": "gateway 与 checkin 共同依赖的文件：出现在 diff 时按依赖顺序 two-phase（先 gateway 后 checkin，各自重启）",
    "files": ["monitor/lib/utils.js", "monitor/lib/module.js", "monitor/package.json"]
  },
  "applyOrder": ["gateway", "checkin", "release"],
  "consumers": {
    "$comment": "共享库消费方声明：文件变更时，除拥有方模块外，这些消费模块也必须重启（加载新代码），否则长驻进程用旧模块缓存→修复不生效（2026-09-21 workbuddy 误报根因：checkin 模块部署的 lib 修复，gateway 进程未重启且自己也在跑旧 watcher）。checkin 拥有的 lib/providers/*、lib/checkin/*、lib/tasks/*、lib/checkin-*.js 均被 server.js import，故消费方都是 gateway。",
    "monitor/lib/providers/index.js": ["gateway"],
    "monitor/lib/providers/common.js": ["gateway"],
    "monitor/lib/providers/trae.js": ["gateway"],
    "monitor/lib/providers/workbuddy.js": ["gateway"],
    "monitor/lib/providers/codearts.js": ["gateway"],
    "monitor/lib/providers/autoclaw.js": ["gateway"],
    "monitor/lib/providers/officeace.js": ["gateway"],
    "monitor/lib/tasks/index.js": ["gateway"],
    "monitor/lib/checkin/checkin.js": ["gateway"],
    "monitor/lib/checkin/scheduler.js": ["gateway"],
    "monitor/lib/checkin/credit-expiry.js": ["gateway"],
    "monitor/lib/checkin/autoclaw.js": ["gateway"],
    "monitor/lib/checkin/codearts.js": ["gateway"],
    "monitor/lib/checkin/officeace.js": ["gateway"],
    "monitor/lib/checkin-log.js": ["gateway"],
    "monitor/lib/checkin-stats.js": ["gateway"]
  }
}
